From 74e1e6b7ce66ce57bd3019f4725732a2172ab92e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Medium1992 <Medium1992@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:03:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 89/91] XHTTP: Widen a probing client's windows once a round

While its group probed, a governed client multiplied a settled
download's cap by the probe's gain on every credit frame, though the
model sets the cap once a round: forty WINDOW_UPDATEs in one round took
a 64 KiB cap to 493 MB, and the probe released far more than it
measured. The gain now scales the target the model sets for a new
round; within the round the cap stays.
---
